# Kanban Live — Fase 1. Mismos escenarios que README.md, para REST Client (VS Code) / IntelliJ HTTP Client.
# Requisitos: `docker compose up -d` en infra/ y backend con perfil local en :8080.
# Ejecuta las peticiones EN ORDEN (las variables se encadenan con las respuestas).
# El token dura 5 min: vuelve a ejecutar "token" si recibes 401.

@api = http://localhost:8080
@keycloak = http://localhost:8180

### token (cliente kanban-dev-cli solo para desarrollo local; password grant)
# @name token
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/kanban/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=kanban-dev-cli&username=owner&password=owner

###
@jwt = {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### 1. crear workspace
# @name workspace
POST {{api}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Equipo Demo" }

###
@workspaceId = {{workspace.response.body.id}}

### 1. listar workspaces
GET {{api}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 1. crear board
# @name board
POST {{api}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sprint 1" }

###
@boardId = {{board.response.body.id}}

### 1. crear lista Todo
# @name todo
POST {{api}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/lists
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Todo" }

###
@todoId = {{todo.response.body.id}}

### 1. crear lista Doing
# @name doing
POST {{api}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/lists
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Doing" }

###
@doingId = {{doing.response.body.id}}

### 1. crear tarjeta 1
# @name card1
POST {{api}}/api/lists/{{todoId}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Tarjeta 1" }

###
@card1 = {{card1.response.body.id}}

### 1. crear tarjeta 2
# @name card2
POST {{api}}/api/lists/{{todoId}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Tarjeta 2", "description": "detalle" }

###
@card2 = {{card2.response.body.id}}

### 1. crear tarjeta 3
# @name card3
POST {{api}}/api/lists/{{todoId}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Tarjeta 3" }

###
@card3 = {{card3.response.body.id}}

### 2. tablero completo (listas y tarjetas ordenadas por position)
GET {{api}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 3a. mover tarjeta 3 entre 1 y 2 (misma lista): solo cambia su fila (version 0 -> 1)
POST {{api}}/api/cards/{{card3}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listId": "{{todoId}}", "prevCardId": "{{card1}}", "nextCardId": "{{card2}}" }

### 3b. mover tarjeta 1 a la lista Doing (vacia, sin vecinas)
POST {{api}}/api/cards/{{card1}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listId": "{{doingId}}" }

### 3c. mover lista Doing al principio (antes de Todo)
POST {{api}}/api/lists/{{doingId}}/move
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nextListId": "{{todoId}}" }

### 4. editar tarjeta 2 con la version actual (0) -> 200, version 1
PATCH {{api}}/api/cards/{{card2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Tarjeta 2 editada", "description": "x", "version": 0 }

### 4. editar tarjeta 2 con la version vieja (0) -> 409 STALE_VERSION
PATCH {{api}}/api/cards/{{card2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "conflicto", "version": 0 }

### renombrar board (version actual 0) / lista
PATCH {{api}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sprint 1 (renombrado)", "version": 0 }

###
PATCH {{api}}/api/lists/{{todoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Todo (renombrada)", "version": 0 }

### 5. 404 board inexistente
GET {{api}}/api/boards/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 5. 404 lista inexistente al crear tarjeta
POST {{api}}/api/lists/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x" }

### 5. 422 nombre vacio
POST {{api}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### 5. 422 falta version
PATCH {{api}}/api/cards/{{card2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "sin version" }

### 5. 401 sin token
GET {{api}}/api/workspaces

### 5. 401 token invalido
GET {{api}}/api/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer basura

### borrar tarjeta 3 -> 204 (segunda vez 404)
DELETE {{api}}/api/cards/{{card3}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 7. OpenAPI (publico en perfil local)
GET {{api}}/v3/api-docs

### 6. Rebalanceo: ver README.md y rebalance-demo.sh (necesita ~200 peticiones; no es práctico a mano)
